00:58:11.050 --> 00:58:16.550
<v Ron Rosenbaum>I'm dead. Everyone you know is dead. Here's what I'd like you to do.
<v Ron Rosenbaum>我死了。你知道的每个人都死了。这是我希望你做的事。

00:58:16.550 --> 00:58:21.550
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着《美国生活》的更多故事回来。
